{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00196",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.87,
      "end_seconds": 7.09,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "text": "Doctor, hello, I've got my papers here, where should I put them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.9,
      "end_seconds": 12.93,
      "duration_seconds": 5.03,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.07,
      "end_seconds": 19.13,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "Doctor, it's poor appetite. It's getting on my nerves now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.11,
      "end_seconds": 23.44,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Since when have you had this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.41,
      "end_seconds": 33.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.31,
      "text": "About... well, about a month. I wasn't sure whether to come in at all, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.09,
      "end_seconds": 39.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Anything that tends to go along with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.48,
      "end_seconds": 48.52,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "It, It usually comes with trouble sleeping. Well, the trouble sleeping? That's been for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.56,
      "end_seconds": 65.47,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Did you get drinking more than usual, thoughts of harming myself or hearing voices?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.88,
      "end_seconds": 75.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.37,
      "text": "No drinking more than usual, thoughts of harming myself or hearing voices, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 80.05,
      "end_seconds": 84.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.34,
      "text": "Have you had any weight loss or panic attacks?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.65,
      "end_seconds": 89.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Yeah, none, as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.84,
      "end_seconds": 93.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "Understood. Has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.28,
      "end_seconds": 97.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "No, nothing with my heart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.08,
      "end_seconds": 105.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 107.14,
      "end_seconds": 121.28,
      "duration_seconds": 14.14,
      "text": "I work on a farm, it's quite physical. I go to the gym a couple of times a week. It's just me and my wife at home now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 121.81,
      "end_seconds": 125.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Tell me what you take day to day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.34,
      "end_seconds": 140.46,
      "duration_seconds": 14.12,
      "text": "Well, I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day. Clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day. I, I'd been on sertraline, not any more though, I stopped."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.21,
      "end_seconds": 143.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.55,
      "end_seconds": 149.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "I had a bypass operation six years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.64,
      "end_seconds": 155.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.2,
      "end_seconds": 178.16,
      "duration_seconds": 20.96,
      "text": "Well, I've had depression for five years now. I'd rather not end up on lots of tablets if I can avoid it. Okay, so I've had heart disease, yes. My family kept telling me to get it checked."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.89,
      "end_seconds": 185.24,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "Uh-huh. Do you have any allergies to medicines, food, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.61,
      "end_seconds": 189.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Yes, I'm allergic to latex."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.09,
      "end_seconds": 192.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Can I take your vitals now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.48,
      "end_seconds": 203.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Just relax your arm..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.12,
      "end_seconds": 225.55,
      "duration_seconds": 11.43,
      "text": "Okay: blood pressure 109 over 81, temperature is 36.7 degrees, heart rate 80. And respiratory rate 16, SpO2 99 percent on room air."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.41,
      "end_seconds": 229.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "Okay, a quick examination now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.88,
      "end_seconds": 246.87,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "That's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.4,
      "end_seconds": 250.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.23,
      "text": "Let me just check something."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.94,
      "end_seconds": 272.94,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "You're well kempt and speaking clearly, and you maintain good eye contact."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.57,
      "end_seconds": 287.5,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Good, that's the examination. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a depressive episode. Another possibility is a reaction to recent stress."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 289.01,
      "end_seconds": 292.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Oh, is it something serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.97,
      "end_seconds": 301.7,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now a depressive episode is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.34,
      "end_seconds": 317.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "I want blood tests done, that's for low mood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 321.17,
      "end_seconds": 322.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "Will it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.2,
      "end_seconds": 326.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "Is there anything you wanted to ask?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.7,
      "end_seconds": 330.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.08,
      "end_seconds": 332.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}